			id: "4190000000000001"
			title: "Temperature Changes the Process"
			description: ["Start with a Blast Furnace as the simplest visible example of temperature-specific processing. A chemical formula says which elements are present; it does not describe melting range, atmosphere, phase transitions or heat treatment. High-temperature metallurgy is therefore a process discipline, not a larger version of ordinary crafting."]
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.2d
			tasks: [{ id: "5190000000000001", item: "minecraft:blast_furnace", type: "item" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6290000000000001", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
		}
		{
