			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "4190000000000002"
			title: "Composition Is a Constraint"
			description: ["Keep separate iron and copper samples while thinking about alloys. Industrial alloys are not defined by two arbitrary ingredients touching each other: ratio, impurities and processing route matter. Matterworks therefore refuses shortcuts that treat ingredient presence as a complete alloy specification."]
