			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "4190000000000003"
			title: "Ceramics Follow Different Rules"
			description: ["Compare fired brick and quartz with metallic feedstocks. Ceramics and ceramic-matrix composites depend on bonding, porosity and microstructure rather than metallic alloying alone. They therefore need their own processing family instead of being hidden inside a generic alloy recipe."]
