			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "4190000000000004"
			title: "Inspect the Quarantined Process Layer"
			description: ["Build a NuclearCraft Chemical Reactor only after the ordinary process industry exists. Several of its molten-alloy recipes depend on material states or tags that Matterworks intentionally keeps quarantined. Owning the machine teaches where those routes would live; it does not make an invalid route valid."]
