			id: "4190000000000005"
			title: "Keep Metallurgical Families Separate"
			description: ["Use an Alloy Smelter as the reference machine for the next distinction: steel grades, stainless alloys, superconductors, refractory alloys, ceramics and high-pressure carbon will become separate production families. A family leaves quarantine only when Matterworks has both a physically meaningful route and a correctly placed Main Program milestone."]
